From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 07:07:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: usb: samsung,exynos-dwc3: Add Exynos9820 USB
 controller

The controller of this SoC is the one another SoC of this family already
describes, down to the pair of clocks it runs on, so it is added as a
compatible falling back to that one rather than as a variant of its own.

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/samsung,exynos-dwc3.yaml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/samsung,exynos-dwc3.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/samsung,exynos-dwc3.yaml
index 8af0143c3e4..bb5346e6a8b 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/samsung,exynos-dwc3.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/samsung,exynos-dwc3.yaml
@@ -24,6 +24,9 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - const: samsung,exynos8890-dwusb3
           - const: samsung,exynos7-dwusb3
+      - items:
+          - const: samsung,exynos9820-dwusb3
+          - const: samsung,exynos850-dwusb3
       - items:
           - const: samsung,exynos990-dwusb3
           - const: samsung,exynos850-dwusb3
